 "forge_note": "Forge pictures: heads centred on the 45 frame, crystal drawn centred on crystal_at (given in the head picture's own pixels). Shafts are 45 wide with an 11 px pole: hold, sockets, then a plain length, then 9 empty rows under pommel_at. Shaft icons lie down, top to the right.",
